topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-11T10:06:23Z","updated_at":"2026-08-15T13:28:16Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122295","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122295","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122295.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122295.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Reduces binary size at the time of writing (Fedora 44):\r\n  - `scons target=template_release production=yes` -> Roughly 260kb\r\n  - `scons target=editor production=yes` -> Roughly 450kb\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nPreviously `_insert_uninitialized` was specialized for all types with which cow data (Vector) was specialized.\r\n\r\nThis PR delegates to a helper method that is only templated based on the size of the type (and if the type is not trivially copyable, the type as well to support forking). So a lot of CowData specializations can share the same implementation of `_insert_uninitialized`.\r\n\r\nBased on my (limited) understanding of the code the only possible performance impact would be from code locality. Since I worked on this as a learning exercise my testing has been limited to the unit tests for now.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>\r\nAI Disclosure\r\n</summary>\r\n\r\nAll code in this PR is hand written. However before doing that I used a Copilot POC to validate that my idea on how template bloat could be reduced was correct. I never looked at the LLM results beyond building them and comparing sizes.\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122295/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122295/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}